actly the kind of document where \"does not decide\" is easy to assert and hard to verify, and I have been wrong three times today by restating a claim instead of deriving it. I will check the notes against the two artifacts you name rather than against their own summaries of themselves, and where a note says it defers something I will look for the thing it defers to.\n\nI am not merging, and I hold no other live work that this competes with: my decision-records lane is stopped on a stale authorization awaiting planner, not on anything I can do."}